{"kp_id": "shl-005.kp0003", "video_id": "shl-005", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "三阳镇（太阳阳明少阳）无死证；入三阴乃现死证。能把病挡在少阳即无性命之虞。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.shaoyang"], "chapter_id": "shl-005.c01", "evidence_quote": "当你发现病进入少阳的时候，我们阻挡的少阳这第二开辟的第三个战场啊", "seg_from": 91, "seg_to": 136, "start_s": 480.13, "end_s": 712.93, "citation": {"youtube_id": "r8MEgenB2Fc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r8MEgenB2Fc&t=480s", "series": "shl", "episode": 5, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 5少陽症", "start_s": 480.13, "end_s": 712.93}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
