{"kp_id": "shl-005.kp0005", "video_id": "shl-005", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "少阳在半表半里，禁吐、下、汗；耳目口鼻诸窍病亦属少阳，勿妄用吐下。宜和解。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.shaoyang"], "chapter_id": "shl-005.c03", "evidence_quote": "所少阳政是和解，好用吐下汉法都不好啊，要和解", "seg_from": 266, "seg_to": 269, "start_s": 1418.946, "end_s": 1459.511, "citation": {"youtube_id": "r8MEgenB2Fc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r8MEgenB2Fc&t=1418s", "series": "shl", "episode": 5, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 5少陽症", "start_s": 1418.95, "end_s": 1459.51}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "政=证；汉=汗", "source": "llm_read"}
